{
 "units": [
  {
   "unit_id": "unit-c43f3552cfbf4c9baae94527aa67e48a",
   "title": "准备与规划",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "用户要求摸清当前 Jenkins CI 的状况，包括主 Jenkinsfile 的作用和挂载的所有 job。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t000",
       "char_start": 58,
       "char_end": 97
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "用户要求迁移期间 Jenkins 必须保持可用，不要提前下线。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t000",
       "char_start": 104,
       "char_end": 130
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "助手计划读取 Jenkinsfile 并使用 Jenkins CLI 列出所有 job。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t001",
       "char_start": 123,
       "char_end": 174
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "主流水线包括 install、lint 和 12 个包的串行 build 与 typecheck 阶段。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t003",
       "char_start": 18,
       "char_end": 64
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "测试阶段使用 4 个并行分片。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t003",
       "char_start": 77,
       "char_end": 89
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "在 main 分支上执行 Docker 构建、staging 部署和人工审批的生产部署。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t003",
       "char_start": 92,
       "char_end": 142
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Jenkins 上共有 5 个 job，分别是 monorepo-pr、monorepo-main、nightly-e2e、release-tag、dependency-audit。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t007",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 183
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "已安装的 Jenkins 插件共 12 个。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t010",
       "char_start": 256,
       "char_end": 264
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "助手指出这些插件在 GitHub Actions 中均有替代方案，例如 junit 用 junit artifact，slack 用官方 action，credentials-binding 用 environment secrets。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t010",
       "char_start": 13,
       "char_end": 128
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "助手提出三个工作流的迁移方案：build.yml（PR+main，matrix 构建12个包）、test.yml（4 分片测试）和 deploy.yml（仅 main，由 test 触发，staging 自动，production 需审批）。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t012",
       "char_start": 45,
       "char_end": 324
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "用户要求所有 secrets 必须使用 GitHub Environments，禁止写入 workflow 文件，且生产环境审批人设为 platform-leads。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t013",
       "char_start": 16,
       "char_end": 115
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "助手确认使用两个 environment：staging（无审批）和 production（审批人 platform-leads），kubeconfig 以 base64 存储。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t014",
       "char_start": 42,
       "char_end": 163
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "用户担心 matrix 并发打爆 runner 额度，助手计划在 build matrix 上设置 max-parallel 为 4 并启用 cancel-in-progress。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t016",
       "char_start": 34,
       "char_end": 49
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t016",
       "char_start": 112,
       "char_end": 136
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "方案写入 docs/ci-migration-plan.md，包含四个里程碑 M1-M4，nightly-e2e 推迟到最后迁移。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t018",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 72
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "用户决定从 build 工作流开始，先不迁移 nightly-e2e。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t019",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 60
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
