  {
   "unit_id": "unit-90ad9a5a43e04778a0df9672a26280d5",
   "title": "迁移 build 工作流",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "用户启动 build 工作流迁移，助手创建 .github/workflows/build.yml，包含对 12 个包的 matrix 构建。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t023",
       "char_start": 253,
       "char_end": 394
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "第一次运行失败，所有 12 个 matrix job 均因 pnpm 命令未找到而报错（exit 127）。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t026",
       "char_start": 10,
       "char_end": 58
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "修复措施包括添加 pnpm/action-setup@v4 并固定 9.6.0 版本，启用 setup-node 的 pnpm 缓存，以及加入 turbo 缓存。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t026",
       "char_start": 136,
       "char_end": 223
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "第二次运行成功，12/12 matrix 全部通过，wall clock 9 分 41 秒，较 Jenkins 串行约 23 分钟缩短超过一半。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t029",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 92
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "第二次运行 turbo 缓存命中率 89%（32/36 命中），pnpm store 缓存 412MB 恢复正常。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t032",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 54
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "M1 里程碑达成，build.yml 标记为稳定。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t032",
       "char_start": 54,
       "char_end": 79
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
