  {
   "unit_id": "unit-020332cf34ef456aac92d3cb8d03fb6d",
   "title": "测试流水线迁移",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "用户要求开始迁移 test 工作流，并全量运行测试。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t033",
       "char_start": 11,
       "char_end": 49
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "助手创建 test.yml，设置 fail-fast 为 false 以保持 shard 独立性，并上传 junit XML 报告。",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t034",
       "char_start": 80,
       "char_end": 162
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The test run revealed flaky failures in digestScheduler and indexRebuild.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t037",
       "char_start": 20,
       "char_end": 200
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t038",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The digestScheduler test failure was caused by a hardcoded +8h timezone offset that fails on UTC runners.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t041",
       "char_start": 22,
       "char_end": 69
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The indexRebuild test failed due to a port conflict when shards share a runner.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t036",
       "char_start": 48059,
       "char_end": 48116
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The fix for digestScheduler uses fake timers and computes the expected slot with the user's timezone.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t042",
       "char_start": 237,
       "char_end": 398
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The fix for indexRebuild uses an ephemeral port to avoid collisions.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t044",
       "char_start": 214,
       "char_end": 238
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The test rerun passed all tests with 0 failures.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t045",
       "char_start": 47582,
       "char_end": 47626
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The execution time was 6 minutes 12 seconds using 4 shards.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t045",
       "char_start": 47709,
       "char_end": 47751
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The assistant noted that three previously flaky tests are now stable.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t046",
       "char_start": 32,
       "char_end": 47
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The user requested test summary reporting like Jenkins' JUnit page.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t047",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 51
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The workflow was updated to include a step that publishes per-shard JUnit summary.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t048",
       "char_start": 86,
       "char_end": 210
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "A separate report job was added to merge all shard JUnit reports and produce a total summary.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t048",
       "char_start": 233,
       "char_end": 522
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Assistant confirmed the change produces per-shard summaries, a merged total table, and 30-day artifact retention.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t049",
       "char_start": 7,
       "char_end": 111
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
